        {
          "text": " ku araabe atarikuriira ha nshozi, atarikwimukiza maisho ebishushani by'enju ya Israeli ebirikuramibwa, atarikushiisha muka mutaahi we, n'obu kwakuba okuhika omukazi ori omu kwezi, ",
