        },
        {
          "text": "orikukora kubi abooro n'abakyene, orikunyaga eby'abandi, otarikugarura kyakwwatiriziibwe, orikwimukiza amaisho ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, orikukora ebihagaro. ",
