          "text": " orikuguza ngu bamuhe ekiteebwamu, akatwara enshaagi, omwana ogwo aryagumaho? Tarigumaho. Ahabw'okukora ebihagaro ebyo byona, taribura kufa; kandi orubanuja rw'eshagama ruryaba ahariwe.",
