        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka ishe, ahabw'okuba akaita kubi abantu ataine saasi, yaanyaga mwene waabo, yaakora omu bantu ebitari birungi, reeba, ogwo aryafa ahabw'okuhikiirira kwe. ",
