        {
          "text": " N'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, nimugira muti: Ahabw'enki omwana tarikuturwa okutahikiirira kwa ishe? Omwana ku arikora eby'ebiragiro kandi ebihikire, yaata omutima aha kworobera ebiragiro byangye byona, buzimazima aryagumaho. ",
