        {
          "text": "Kwonka omuntu mubi ku arihinduka yaareka ebibi ebi yaakozire byona, yaayorobera ebiragiro byangye byona, yaakora eby'ebiragiro kandi ebihikire, buzimazima aryagumaho, tarifa. ",
