            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu ohikiriire ku arihinduka yaareka okuhikiirira kwe, yaakora eby'okutahikiirira, yaaakora ebihagaro ebi omusiisi akora, aryagumaho? Omu by'okuhikiirira byona ebi yaakozire tihariho na kimwe ekirimwijukwaho; ahabw'ekicumuro eki acumwire, n'ekibi eki akozire, aryafa.",
