        },
        {
          "text": " N'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, nimugira muti: Emitwarize ya MUKAMA tehikire. Imwe b'enju ya Israeli 'mwe, nimugira ngu emitwarize yangye tehikire? Eyaanyu tiyo etahikire? ",
