              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, enju ya Israeli neegira eti: Emitwarize ya Mukama tehikire. Imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe, nimugira ngu emitwarize yangye tehikire? Eyaanyu tiyo etahikire? ",
