              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo imwe ab'enju ya Israeli, nikyo ndibacwerera orubanja, buri muntu nk'oku emitwarize ye eri; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. Mweteise, muhindukye, murekye eby'okushiisha byanyu byona, okutahikiirira kurekye kubacwekyereza. ",
          "type": "text",
