              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Munagye hare eby'okushisha byanyu byona, ebi mwancumwireho, mwetungire omutima musya n'omwoyo musya! Mbwenu nimwendera ki kufa, imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe? ",
